WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.960
S’il vous plaît. 

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.920
Jamy, Jamy, Jamy.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.080
Jamy ! 

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.240
Doucement, doucement !

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.240
Merci, vraiment,
merci beaucoup

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.600
